<title>GREECE: GREEK OTE SHORTLISTS 7 FOR DCS1800 PROCUREMENT.</title>
<headline>GREEK OTE SHORTLISTS 7 FOR DCS1800 PROCUREMENT.</headline>
<dateline>ATHENS 1997-03-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Greece's state-run telecoms company OTE picked seven out of 15 candidate firms to continue in the second round for the procurement of material related to the DCS 1800 system, it said in a statement.</p>
<p>The seven firms are Alcatel, Intrakom -Ericsson, Lucent Telecommunications-Bell Laboratories Innovations, Motorola Ltd, Northern Telecom, Siemens A.G. and Nokia Telecommunications, it said. --Dimitris Kontogiannis, Athens Newsroom +301 3311812-4</p>
</text>
